---
// Generic illustration: many routes to one outcome. Advocacy theme; says nothing about any individual.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 560 305" role="img" aria-labelledby="d3t d3d">
  <title id="d3t">Fits more minds</title>
  <desc id="d3d">Five people, each shown as a different shape, start on the left. A single prescribed route would suit only one of them. Instead, each has their own route, and all five arrive at the same outcome.</desc>
  <path d="M70 138 H450 M70 162 H450" class="ghost" />
  <text x="260" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="sm halo">one prescribed route</text>
  <path d="M58 150 H454" class="ln r3" />
  <path d="M56 50 C200 50 300 150 454 150" class="ln r1"  />
  <path d="M56 100 H140 V78 H260 V122 H360 V150 H454" class="ln r2"  />
  <path d="M56 200 C140 200 160 232 230 216 S330 172 380 160 S430 150 454 150" class="ln r4"  />
  <path d="M58 250 C120 264 170 242 150 224 C136 212 118 234 160 240 C260 254 380 190 454 150" class="ln r5"  />
  <g class="trav" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle r="3.6" class="tdot r1"><animateMotion dur="5.2s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M56 50 C200 50 300 150 454 150" /></circle>
    <circle r="3.6" class="tdot r2"><animateMotion dur="6.4s" begin="1.1s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M56 100 H140 V78 H260 V122 H360 V150 H454" /></circle>
    <circle r="3.6" class="tdot r4"><animateMotion dur="5.8s" begin="2.3s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M56 200 C140 200 160 232 230 216 S330 172 380 160 S430 150 454 150" /></circle>
    <circle r="3.6" class="tdot r5"><animateMotion dur="7.2s" begin="0.6s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M58 250 C120 264 170 242 150 224 C136 212 118 234 160 240 C260 254 380 190 454 150" /></circle>
  </g>
  <circle cx="40" cy="50" r="12" class="shp" /><rect x="28" y="88" width="24" height="24" class="shp" /><path d="M40 138 L52 162 H28 Z" class="shp" />
  <path d="M40 186 L52 200 L40 214 L28 200 Z" class="shp" /><path d="M28 250 L34 238 H46 L52 250 L46 262 H34 Z" class="shp" />
  <circle cx="486" cy="150" r="30" class="ring-d pulse" /><circle cx="486" cy="150" r="13" class="dot ok glow" />
  <text x="486" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="sm">same outcome</text>
  <text x="260" y="296" text-anchor="middle" class="sm">many ways in</text>
  <g class="mk"><circle cx="40" cy="18" r="9" /><text x="40" y="21.5">1</text></g>
  <g class="mk"><circle cx="388" cy="102" r="9" /><text x="388" y="105.5">2</text></g>
  <g class="mk"><circle cx="486" cy="108" r="9" /><text x="486" y="111.5">3</text></g>
</svg>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><b>1</b> People start from different places</li>
  <li><b>2</b> Each finds a route that works</li>
  <li><b>3</b> Same outcome for everyone</li>
</ol>

<style>
  .tdot { fill: var(--accent); stroke: none; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px var(--accent)); }
  .tdot.r2 { fill: var(--accent3); } .tdot.r4 { fill: var(--accent2); } .tdot.r5 { fill: var(--fg); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .trav { display: none; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .pulse { transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; animation: arrive 3.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes arrive { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); stroke-opacity: 0.6; } 50% { transform: scale(1.12); stroke-opacity: 1; } }
  }
</style>
